<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib74.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Judging llm-as-a-judge with mt-bench and chatbot arena.
</span>
</span>
<span class="ltx_bibblock"><span id="bib.bib74.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic" style="font-size:90%;">Advances in Neural Information Processing Systems</span><span id="bib.bib74.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">, 36:46595–46623, 2023.
